<title>FRANCE: Sanofi boosted by Schering results.</title>
<headline>Sanofi boosted by Schering results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of French health and beauty products group Sanofi were boosted on Tuesday by a 66 percent nine-month net profit rise at Germany's Schering AG, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1008 GMT, Sanofi was up 1.85 percent at 468.50 francs.</p>
<p>On Monday, Schering said nine month net profits rose to 286 million marks ($190 million) while sales climbed 12 percent to 3.85 billion marks.</p>
</text>
